    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD COMMUNITY</h1><p><br><br><strong>Take part in the development:</strong> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Share your ideas, <br></li><li>Give your opinion,<br></li><li>Participate in private tests,<br></li><li>Access weekly devlogs,<br></li><li>And make friends \ud83d\udc38</li></ul><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Goofy Dungeon is a light-hearted puzzle game built from the ground up for VR. Explore dungeons, interact with objects and the environment, solve puzzles, complete quests and collect trophies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore dungeons!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833080/extras/f52c8849da9fa0f1090305babd951bf6.poster.avif?t=1676068050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833080/extras/f52c8849da9fa0f1090305babd951bf6.webm?t=1676068050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833080/extras/f52c8849da9fa0f1090305babd951bf6.mp4?t=1676068050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interact with objects and the environment!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833080/extras/6d07b77d2e8160920effba1c10fecf75.poster.avif?t=1676068050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833080/extras/6d07b77d2e8160920effba1c10fecf75.webm?t=1676068050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833080/extras/6d07b77d2e8160920effba1c10fecf75.mp4?t=1676068050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve puzzles</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.